sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Provider
  participant V1 as V1 endpoint/schema
  participant V2 as V2 endpoint/schema
  participant A as Consumer Adapter
  participant O as Observability
  P->>V1: keep producing/serving V1
  P->>V2: publish V2 beside V1
  A->>V2: deploy V2-capable consumer first
  A->>A: switch per consumer with rollback point
  P->>V1: retain V1 during migration
  O->>O: prove 2 releases + 30 days + zero old traffic/backlog
  A-->>V1: all consumers migrated
  P->>V1: retire V1 and reserve identity forever
